  "label": "Physical Exhaustion",
  "description": "The concept of physical exhaustion refers to the state of being extremely tired or drained from physical activity. It is a universal human experience and is often humorously or self-deprecatingly referenced in popular culture. The meme uses this concept to create relatability, implying the person has just completed a strenuous activity (like a long walk) and is now relieved to rest.",
